en39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":44,"created_at":"2026-11-05T01:02:51Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:09:41Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T23:09:35Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\n\nPending email verification state has expiry but no aggregate size bound. In pkgs/id/src/directory_auth.rs:149-161 and 167-188, issue_code sweeps expired entries and then inserts the new address; the map has no hard capacity, and each issuance scans it. Authenticated AddEmail accepts caller-supplied addresses (pkgs/id/src/directory_view.rs:1238-1257). Repeated requests for unique addresses can grow memory without bound and make each later issuance more expensive.\n\nClosed #1732 addressed retention of expired codes but does not bound many unexpired entries.\n\n## Required behavior\n\nIntroduce an explicit global and/or per-principal cap for pending email-code state. Reject or replace excess entries deterministically, preserve normal resend and expiry semantics, and make sure one principal cannot starve unrelated users. Keep verification and one-time-use behavior unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Tests fill the pending-code capacity and verify deterministic rejection or eviction without exceeding the bound.\n- [ ] If per-principal isolation is the chosen policy, a test proves one principal cannot consume every slot.\n- [ ] Expired entries are still reclaimed, and valid codes still verify exactly once.\n- [ ] Issuance cost stays bounded as the number of distinct pending addresses grows.","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/5